9. **need boot gei, wait me, ng hoe hoi chi ju**
   => 需要靴嘅，等我，我開機遲咗
   *(Need boots, wait for me, I turned on the machine late.)*
   *Note: "need" = 需要 (Need). "boot" = 靴 (Boots) or 啟動 (Boot up). "gei" = 嘅 (Particle). "wait me" = 等我 (Wait for me). "ng" = 我 (I). "hoe" = 開 (Open). "hoi" = 機 (Machine). "chi" = 遲 (Late). "ju" = 咗 (Past tense).*
   => **需要靴嘅，等我，我開機遲咗** (Need boots, wait for me, I turned on the machine late.)
   *Or:* **需要啟動嘅，等我，我開機遲咗** (Need to boot up, wait for me, I turned on the machine late.)

